-- whose kill credits an unspawned objective, and works an event's chain (use, kill, talk: q6001/q6002), so the failure
-- record forgets the give-ups it counted for them: the no-place, no-target, no-item and unsupported:event rows of the
-- 384 quests with a summon or transform chain or a kill credit in the facts listing (`playerbots planner questuse
-- facts` on lab13, 2026-11-21), and of 6001 and 6002. A row of a quest that still fails is written again with its cause
